0089 window-tag: WindowOptions::tag, what a window is for, named for the user's window rules: Wayland's xdg-toplevel-tag-v1 tag and description, set before the first commit where the compositor offers it, X11's WM_WINDOW_ROLE; the other systems leave it unread

